Noto Sans SC, a variable font shipped unmodified from the Google Fonts
release of NotoSansSC[wght].ttf and only renamed.  It carries the Chinese
glyphs the Latin face has none of, wherever Hiragino is not available.  The
licence text is in OFL.txt beside it.
